# svc-repel-repeat: the repeat-Repel prompt (OpenSinnoh option `repelPrompt`, HGSS's behaviour; docs/decisions.md
# 2026-10-19). Run with the option on (tests/integration/qol.rom.test.ts; the contract default is off, where the same
# walk ends at the ROM's wore-off message). A Repel used from the Bag; 100 steps in Route 201's grass (lead level 20:
# no wild battle); CommonScript_RepelsEffectWoreOff; then "Use another Repel?" in the field box, YES uses the second.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_TURTWIG 20
give item platinum:ITEM_REPEL 2
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_201 115 853 right
until idle
+1 wild flee
+1 press x
+1 release x
until app start-menu
